open audit.log
write audit.log: start
open main.log
open a
open b
open c
write b: touched
write c: inner
close c
close b
write a: outer
close a
open loop
write loop: iteration
close loop
open loop
close loop
open arg
write arg: consumed
close arg
open in
open out
write in: read
write out: write
close out
close in
open in
close in
error: empty file name
p cleared
write shared: still open
close shared
q cleared
open app.log
write app.log: hello
logger app done
close app.log
open boxed
write boxed: through an interface
write boxed: from a closure
closure released
close boxed
write main.log: bye
main: deferred call
close main.log
close audit.log
